[[2047,96,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The two front fog lights \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (left)\nand \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F16</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (right) are supplied through the fog lights relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               by\nthe direct line from the battery - maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              )- and\nthrough fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              of the additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The signal which energizes the coil for\nthe relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               arrives from the integrated services control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 11 of connector C) according to the enablement logic\ndescribed.</p><p>The control unit receives the signal that\nthe side lights are on from the switch for the steering column switch\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 8 of connector C) and the supply is controlled\nby the ignition (INT) from the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the junction\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 7 of connector B).</p><p>When the engagement signal also arrives\nfrom the button in \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 1 of connector B), the control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the command to the front fog lights relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>This signal also lightsup the LED next to\nthe button in \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply line for the two fog lights also\nsends a signal to the rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 14 of connector\nB) to light up the &#x27;front fog lights on&#x27; warning light.</p><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is lit up when the\nside lights are switched on by means of the line coming from the\nswitch for the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]